    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7e0ca0fd007cb4f0",
      "translationZh": "为什么要微调？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2f48364fec3d07a",
      "translationZh": "对 Sentence Transformer 模型进行微调，可以显著提升其在特定任务上的表现。这是因为每项任务都需要一种独特的相似性定义。我们以两则新闻报道的标题为例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63257de679fd0889",
      "translationZh": "“Apple 推出新款 iPad”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "475bff6ddf8b3326",
      "translationZh": "“NVIDIA 正在为下一代 GPU 做准备”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe82caab7ba66459",
      "translationZh": "根据具体用例，我们可能希望这些文本的嵌入相似，也可能希望它们不相似。例如，新闻文章分类模型可以将这些文本视为相似，因为它们都属于科技类别。另一方面，语义文本相似度模型或检索模型则应将它们视为不相似，因为它们的含义不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f8dcb943e353273d",
      "translationZh": "训练组件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13dcf7523ca6054d",
      "translationZh": "训练 Sentence Transformer 模型涉及以下组件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f45379153c90ecd",
      "translationZh": "数据集：用于训练和评估的数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9e5830f1966db8c",
      "translationZh": "损失函数：量化模型表现并指导优化过程的函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8080030bdbabaf5c",
      "translationZh": "训练参数（可选）：影响训练性能以及跟踪／调试的参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb22a5ff4b4f0969",
      "translationZh": "评估器（可选）：用于在训练前、训练期间或训练后评估模型的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c763f32b90c4f813",
      "translationZh": "训练器：将模型、数据集、损失函数和其他组件整合起来，用于训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9540ce4b6ee39c68",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们更详细地了解这些组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4411e525721e7dd8",
      "translationZh": "数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d8ba4b7da7ba7f1",
      "translationZh": "SentenceTransformerTrainer 使用 datasets.Dataset 或 datasets.DatasetDict 实例进行训练和评估。你可以从 Hugging Face Datasets Hub 加载数据，也可以使用 CSV、JSON、Parquet、Arrow 或 SQL 等各种格式的本地数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54373760cd0d6e5a",
      "translationZh": "注意：许多可以直接与 Sentence Transformers 配合使用的 Hugging Face 数据集都已添加 sentence-transformers 标签，你可以访问 https://huggingface.co/datasets?other=sentence-transformers 轻松找到它们。我们强烈建议你浏览这些数据集，寻找可能对你的任务有用的训练数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cf6df86755ef5ea",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Hub 上的数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9804b8ec7740a972",
      "translationZh": "要从 Hugging Face Hub 中的数据集加载数据，请使用 load_dataset 函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9bd3919e4db3f4c",
      "translationZh": "某些数据集（如 sentence-transformers/all-nli）包含多个采用不同数据格式的子集。你需要在指定数据集名称的同时指定子集名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6ae4d732ec616458",
      "translationZh": "本地数据（CSV、JSON、Parquet、Arrow、SQL）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28ca47ab337b1cfe",
      "translationZh": "如果你有采用常见文件格式的本地数据，也可以使用 load_dataset 轻松加载：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5aa1234de0dfea86",
      "translationZh": "需要预处理的本地数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "957b297c4785004f",
      "translationZh": "如果你的本地数据需要预处理，可以使用 datasets.Dataset.from_dict，通过一个以列表为值的字典来初始化数据集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3e830f127ee2c22",
      "translationZh": "字典中的每个键都会成为所生成数据集中的一列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "791adb8eabc41d04",
      "translationZh": "数据集格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c31c8e0698deeaa",
      "translationZh": "确保数据集格式与你选择的损失函数相匹配至关重要。这需要检查两点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41682d4a511f6f87",
      "translationZh": "如果你的损失函数需要标签（如损失函数概览表中所示），你的数据集就必须包含一个名为 \"label\" 或 \"score\" 的列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8c0aacf78c30d90",
      "translationZh": "除 \"label\" 或 \"score\" 之外的所有列都被视为输入（如损失函数概览表中所示）。这些列的数量必须与你所选损失函数的有效输入数量一致。列名并不重要，只有列的顺序才重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afdc6c2534ef7436",
      "translationZh": "例如，如果你的损失函数接受 (anchor, positive, negative) 三元组，那么数据集的第一列、第二列和第三列就分别对应锚点、正样本和负样本。这意味着，第一列和第二列必须包含在嵌入空间中应彼此接近的文本，而第一列和第三列必须包含在嵌入空间中应彼此远离的文本。因此，数据集列的顺序是否重要，取决于你使用的损失函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fb2fb782c9c1860",
      "translationZh": "考虑一个包含 [\"text1\", \"text2\", \"label\"] 这些列的数据集，其中 \"label\" 列包含浮点数形式的相似度分数。这个数据集可以与 CoSENTLoss、AnglELoss 和 CosineSimilarityLoss 配合使用，原因如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d44b3cf4bdc4cf7a",
      "translationZh": "该数据集包含这些损失函数所要求的 \"label\" 列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d20c65ef36fed9f",
      "translationZh": "该数据集有 2 个非标签列，与这些损失函数所需的输入数量一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8069103266c9fc2f",
      "translationZh": "如果数据集中的列顺序不正确，请使用 Dataset.select_columns 重新排列它们。此外，请使用 Dataset.remove_columns 删除所有多余的列（例如 sample_id、metadata、source、type），否则它们也会被视为输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "da262d37cfa8c97d",
      "translationZh": "损失函数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "508183b22e7b6c79",
      "translationZh": "损失函数用于衡量模型在给定数据批次上的表现，并指导优化过程。损失函数的选择取决于你可用的数据和目标任务。有关完整的可选项列表，请参阅“损失函数概览”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3640db0abe0716a",
      "translationZh": "大多数损失函数只需传入你正在训练的 SentenceTransformer 模型即可初始化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2abee5d81a6f7d52",
      "translationZh": "训练参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5570cc9f8917c398",
      "translationZh": "SentenceTransformersTrainingArguments 类允许你指定影响训练性能以及跟踪和调试的参数。虽然这些参数是可选的，但尝试调整它们可以帮助提高训练效率，并深入了解训练过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b98ffda17c73776e",
      "translationZh": "我在 Sentence Transformers 文档中概述了一些最有用的训练参数。建议阅读“训练概览 > 训练参数”部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52b1275cf4c99c7f",
      "translationZh": "下面是初始化 SentenceTransformersTrainingArguments 的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c511123ef07c162",
      "translationZh": "请注意，eval_strategy 是在 transformers 4.41.0 版本中引入的。更早的版本应改用 evaluation_strategy。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f2a57bad3d4b112c",
      "translationZh": "评估器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae83c136ff6be225",
      "translationZh": "你可以向 SentenceTransformerTrainer 提供 eval_dataset，以获取训练期间的评估损失，不过，在训练期间获取更具体的指标也可能很有用。为此，你可以使用评估器，在训练前、训练期间或训练后通过实用的指标评估模型性能。你可以同时提供 eval_dataset 和 evaluator，也可以只提供其中一个，或者两个都不提供。它们会根据训练参数中的 eval_strategy 和 eval_steps 进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "828e348fc8af809a",
      "translationZh": "以下是 Sentence Transformers 自带的已实现评估器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2a57bad3d4b112c",
      "translationZh": "评估器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bc392254b9258a9",
      "translationZh": "所需数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef704f8554fed420",
      "translationZh": "带有类别标签的配对数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c0d6bf8c0fb5ce8",
      "translationZh": "带有相似度分数的配对数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7094c84dbe2a0a39",
      "translationZh": "查询（qid => question）、语料库（cid => document）以及相关文档（qid => set[cid]）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c972c95675754c15",
      "translationZh": "由教师模型进行嵌入的源句子，以及由学生模型进行嵌入的目标句子。两者可以是相同的文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddfb70460afe97c2",
      "translationZh": "ID 到句子的映射，以及由重复句子的 ID 组成的配对。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "047aa2f4641c120f",
      "translationZh": "由 {'query': '..', 'positive': [...], 'negative': [...]} 字典组成的列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12c513857e4106a",
      "translationZh": "由两种不同语言的句子组成的句对。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b963a02c298f3be0",
      "translationZh": "(anchor, positive, negative) 形式的配对。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45a8f51f861fde3d",
      "translationZh": "此外，你还可以使用 SequentialEvaluator 将多个评估器合并为一个，然后将其传递给 SentenceTransformerTrainer。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc87f857d3424575",
      "translationZh": "如果你没有所需的评估数据，但仍想跟踪模型在常用基准上的表现，可以将这些评估器与 Hugging Face 上的数据结合使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69f03b1855206ab8",
      "translationZh": "将 EmbeddingSimilarityEvaluator 与 STSb 结合使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e1a0350d8db1cd9",
      "translationZh": "STS Benchmark（又称 STSb）是一个常用的基准测试数据集，用于衡量模型对短文本之间语义相似度的理解能力，例如“一名男子正在把一只老鼠喂给一条蛇。”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f39302d9d1f95f0e",
      "translationZh": "欢迎浏览 Hugging Face 上的 sentence-transformers/stsb 数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7789dd748ebfcc9",
      "translationZh": "将 TripletEvaluator 与 AllNLI 配合使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ff50f17bd4b5771",
      "translationZh": "AllNLI 由 SNLI 和 MultiNLI 数据集拼接而成，这两个数据集都用于自然语言推理。传统上，这项任务用于判断两段文本之间是蕴含关系、矛盾关系，还是两者皆非。后来，它也被用于训练嵌入模型，因为具有蕴含关系和矛盾关系的句子可以构成有用的（锚点、正样本、负样本）三元组：这是训练嵌入模型的一种常见格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea011317827094a3",
      "translationZh": "在这个片段中，它用于评估模型认为锚点文本与蕴含文本之间的相似度高于锚点文本与矛盾文本之间相似度的频率。一个示例文本是：“一位年长的男子正在一家餐馆里喝橙汁。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "846d7ba40279ad6c",
      "translationZh": "欢迎浏览 Hugging Face 上的 sentence-transformers/all-nli 数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f085ee951ec6ad8",
      "translationZh": "训练器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "759724ef3351af3e",
      "translationZh": "SentenceTransformerTrainer 将模型、数据集、损失函数及其他组件整合在一起，用于训练：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cff8505447298ac",
      "translationZh": "在这个示例中，我以 microsoft/mpnet-base 为起点进行微调，这是一个尚未成为 Sentence Transformer 模型的基础模型。与微调已有的 Sentence Transformer 模型（例如 all-mpnet-base-v2）相比，这需要更多的训练数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2440799dfe74ea60",
      "translationZh": "运行此脚本后，tomaarsen/mpnet-base-all-nli-triplet 模型就已为我上传。使用余弦相似度计算的三元组准确率，即 cosine_similarity(anchor, positive) > cosine_similarity(anchor, negative) 成立的比例，在开发集上达到了 90.04%，在测试集上达到了 91.5%！作为参考，microsoft/mpnet-base 模型在训练前的开发集得分仅为 68.32%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "255e0d1cef465833",
      "translationZh": "所有这些信息都存储在自动生成的模型卡中，包括基础模型、语言、许可证、评估结果、训练与评估数据集信息、超参数、训练日志等。你无需付出任何额外精力，上传的模型就应该包含潜在用户判断模型是否适合自己所需的全部信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "55cac01855a1896c",
      "translationZh": "回调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf21eee5dcc5b077",
      "translationZh": "Sentence Transformers 训练器支持多种 transformers.TrainerCallback 子类，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5c73a9646f34337",
      "translationZh": "WandbCallback：如果安装了 wandb，则用于将训练指标记录到 W&B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a534077a67e69854",
      "translationZh": "TensorBoardCallback：如果 tensorboard 可用，则用于将训练指标记录到 TensorBoard",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bf3facecf33fbaf",
      "translationZh": "CodeCarbonCallback：如果安装了 codecarbon，则用于跟踪训练期间的碳排放",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "903d3c95178101d3",
      "translationZh": "只要安装了所需的依赖项，这些回调就会自动启用，无需你进行任何指定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51b97af000134ae8",
      "translationZh": "有关这些回调以及如何创建自己的回调的更多信息，请参阅 Transformers Callbacks 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d445d0f510d1f33b",
      "translationZh": "多数据集训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "946ebeee582030ca",
      "translationZh": "表现最出色的模型通常使用多个数据集同时进行训练。SentenceTransformerTrainer 简化了这一过程，让你无需将多个数据集转换为相同格式即可使用它们进行训练。你甚至可以为每个数据集应用不同的损失函数。以下是多数据集训练的步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d80babb5a4c6682",
      "translationZh": "使用由 datasets.Dataset 实例组成的字典（或 datasets.DatasetDict）作为 train_dataset 和 eval_dataset。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "896804f92d490a9b",
      "translationZh": "（可选）如果你希望对不同的数据集使用不同的损失函数，可以使用一个将数据集名称映射到损失函数的字典。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b9f1dbca577bb30",
      "translationZh": "每个训练/评估批次都只包含来自其中一个数据集的样本。从多个数据集中采样批次的顺序由 MultiDatasetBatchSamplers 枚举决定，该枚举可以通过 multi_dataset_batch_sampler 传入 SentenceTransformersTrainingArguments。有效选项如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b5f20d4ba2d0c7b",
      "translationZh": "MultiDatasetBatchSamplers.ROUND_ROBIN：以轮询方式从每个数据集中采样，直到其中一个数据集耗尽。这种策略可能不会使用每个数据集中的所有样本，但能确保从每个数据集中等量采样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86ca0a96563d9241",
      "translationZh": "MultiDatasetBatchSamplers.PROPORTIONAL（默认）：按照各数据集的大小成比例地从中采样。这种策略确保每个数据集中的所有样本都被使用，并且从较大数据集中采样的频率更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e10acfe4a69c9c3",
      "translationZh": "多任务训练已被证明非常有效。例如，Huang 等人在 2024 年使用 MultipleNegativesRankingLoss、CoSENTLoss，以及一种不使用批内负样本、仅使用难负样本的 MultipleNegativesRankingLoss 变体，在中文任务上取得了最先进的性能。他们还应用了 MatryoshkaLoss，使模型能够生成 Matryoshka Embeddings。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64013635d416cb3f",
      "translationZh": "以下是一个多数据集训练的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7445efca6420bc8d",
      "translationZh": "弃用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58af90c2cb1756ce",
      "translationZh": "在 Sentence Transformer v3 发布之前，所有模型都使用 SentenceTransformer.fit 方法进行训练。从 v3.0 开始，这个方法不会被弃用，而是会在底层使用 SentenceTransformerTrainer。这意味着你原有的训练代码应该仍然可以运行，甚至还能获得多 GPU 训练、损失日志记录等新功能。不过，新的训练方式要强大得多，因此建议使用新方式编写新的训练脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9459e12f91695e9b",
      "translationZh": "更多资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
